  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building Lebanon by Port of Rotterdam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to support the development of a new governance model for the Port of Beirut in Lebanon in order to build back better after the August 2020 blast.This will be done through the secondment of a Chief Technical Advisor and his assistant from the Port of Rotterdam at the Port of Beirut, with contributions from experts based in Rotterdam and World Bank Groups of Experts. The development of a new port strategy and vision will be supported.</narrative>
  </description>
